# AWS Bedrock Promotional Credit Pool Rules

- Enforce strict `max_daily_usd: 0.0`.
- All requests must use promotional credits with a fail-closed $5.00 safety buffer.
- Accounts expiring after 180 days must be retired automatically.
- Always redact AWS Secret Access Keys in responses.
